demo_timing_attack,ursa-mikail,https://github.com/ursa-mikail/demo_timing_attack,readme.md,91,symmetric,AES\b,"Assume that the attacker also observes, by carrying out experiments with known keys k on a computer with the same AES software and the same CPU, that the overall AES time is maximum when k[13]⊕n[13] is, say, 8. The attacker concludes that the victim’s k[13] is 147 ⊕ 8 = 155."
