mechanisms,ursa-mikail,https://github.com/ursa-mikail/mechanisms,security/double_ratchet/golang/readme.md,512,kdf,\bKDF\b,"**How:** Each message uses a unique key derived from a chain. Once used, the message key is deleted. Even if an attacker gets today's chain key, they can't reverse the KDF to get yesterday's message keys."
