mechanisms,ursa-mikail,https://github.com/ursa-mikail/mechanisms,security/double_ratchet/golang/readme.md,537,cipher_mode,\bGCM\b,"**How:** Messages are encrypted with keys derived from a shared secret that only Alice and Bob know (via X3DH and DH ratchets). The encryption (ChaCha20/NaCl/AES-GCM) is authenticated, preventing tampering."
